    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-c593a02ceded88fd61b9b47d",
      "path_or_url": "reservoir.md",
      "section": "Reservoir station > Restart",
      "snippet": "## Restart\n\nRestart the circulation pump only after the inlet sensor reads at least four degrees Celsius. Record the sensor reading in the shift ledger before pressing START.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "f74f4b8a8b5efa9f7962d27a1f8e4cac73fc07efe73e4c8d09568beef93025b4",
      "project_identity": "local:c66db2adc36aa148f59cf0387608cc0c32ff15a9008e4e62863b8e97daf20d09",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 8,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/68b7bb9facfb8e9b0c5793d8"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-ce7f7a00a9de61492a2c75d4",
      "path_or_url": "reservoir.md",
      "section": "Reservoir station > Restart > Inspection",
      "snippet": "### Inspection\n\nBefore restart, inspect the intake grille and remove accumulated leaves. A cracked grille requires replacement before the pump may run.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "5555665ea7b901c9c21f2029a0e595a48e0c3cc519e085297ef2aca84ce16706",
      "project_identity": "local:c66db2adc36aa148f59cf0387608cc0c32ff15a9008e4e62863b8e97daf20d09",
      "line_start": 9,
      "line_end": 12,
