    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-f0704f979684bf6cf644dfdf",
      "path_or_url": "reservoir.md",
      "section": "Reservoir station > Restart > Indicator lamps",
      "snippet": "### Indicator lamps\n\nThe amber cabinet lamp indicates that the maintenance drawer is open. Closing the drawer extinguishes this lamp; the lamp does not measure inlet temperature.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "944b68c6c8f693206778a999409ffa2901d1f59486c74fc351be35df4e86ca22",
      "project_identity": "local:c66db2adc36aa148f59cf0387608cc0c32ff15a9008e4e62863b8e97daf20d09",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 16,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/66627cb92ce29feedc92742c"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-f74434b89b08eac3f11e6676",
      "path_or_url": "reservoir.md",
      "section": "Reservoir station > Frozen intake",
      "snippet": "## Frozen intake\n\nWhen ice remains visible inside the intake, restarting the circulation pump is prohibited even if the inlet sensor reads four degrees Celsius or more. Request a manual thaw inspection instead.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "124e2d8bcb7ea80e5f607ec6d40aad596dbd084bebcb3dd682f5e10de7822d1c",
      "project_identity": "local:c66db2adc36aa148f59cf0387608cc0c32ff15a9008e4e62863b8e97daf20d09",
