      "path_or_url": "reservoir.md",
      "section": "Reservoir station > Ledger storage",
      "snippet": "## Ledger storage\n\nCompleted shift ledgers are archived in the west cabinet for nine months. The cabinet key is held by the records clerk.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "ceba1d345b922a000cb6657cc1bdb7ca7ab4f4d988d422ebd51bd63f1e85c48d",
